<title>USA: Hollinger says settles shareholder suit.</title>
<headline>Hollinger says settles shareholder suit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hollinger International, the U.S. subsidiary of Hollinger Inc, said on Monday it settled a shareholders lawsuit brought against it last week.</p>
<p>Hollinger said in the same news release that it rescheduled a special shareholders meeting for July 31. The meeting originally was set for Monday.</p>
<p>The lawsuit settlement still must be approved by a court, the company said. No further details were provided.</p>
<p>Hollinger International publishes newspapers in the United States, Canada, the United Kingdom and Israel.</p>
